    <string name="stats_title">Help us with anonymous statistics?</string>
    <string name="stats_msg">WTTC can send, at most once a day: app and firmware version, Android version, device type (phone, tablet or radio), country from the system language, number of starts and stops, and fault codes.\n\nLocation, names, Wi-Fi networks, PIN and schedules are never sent, and your IP is not stored. The results are public at wttc.favala.es/estadisticas.php.\n\nYou can change your mind at any time in “App settings”, at the bottom of the screen.</string>
